      src/acceptance/requirement/obligations.py#3
      src/acceptance/requirement/obligations.py#5
      pairs: 4 put to the model, 112 skipped once the defect was covered
    [missing_case] context-blocks-have-no-requirement-id-or-disposition/context-heading-match-exact-only
      A Context section is recognised only when the heading text, lowercased, is exactly `context`. Variants such as `Context:` or a heading with trailing markup do not match. Their background blocks then fall into the `unclaimed` handling, or into another section if one is still active, and may be treated as mandate and given requirement ids.
